      "title": "&f&lA building with a clear purpose&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fGive each building a job, a palette and room for access. Separate noisy processing, storage, food and magical experiments, then connect them with readable paths.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fUse a limited palette with one accent material so the workshop remains easy to navigate.",
        "",
